{"id":"cd8dcab3ce41cbc6","group":"92","path":"92/92-book-info.md","title":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","display":"book-info — Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","type":"info","metadata":{"type":"info","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-book-info","aliases":["92-book-info"],"display":"book-info — Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","depends_on":[]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"info"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-book-info"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-book-info</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"book-info — Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>(none)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"书籍基本信息\">书籍基本信息</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>作者</strong>: Raymond M. Smullyan</li>\n<li><strong>书名</strong>: Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems</li>\n<li><strong>出版社</strong>: Oxford University Press</li>\n<li><strong>年份</strong>: 1992</li>\n<li><strong>编号</strong>: 92</li>\n<li><strong>主题</strong>: 数理逻辑、不完备性定理、自引用</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"书籍特点\">书籍特点</h2>\n<p>Smullyan的这本书以独特的风格呈现Gödel不完备性定理：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>系统G方法</strong>: 使用自定义的&quot;系统G&quot;作为核心形式系统</li>\n<li><strong>可表示性</strong>: 强调可表示性而非直接的Gödel编码</li>\n<li><strong>自引用系统</strong>: 使用正规函数和对角化实现自引用</li>\n<li><strong>清晰证明</strong>: 提供了第一不完备性定理、第二不完备性定理的详细证明</li>\n<li><strong>Löb定理</strong>: 详细讨论Löb定理及其与第二不完备性定理的关系</li>\n<li><strong>Tarski定理</strong>: 包含Tarski不可定义定理的讨论</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念体系\">核心概念体系</h2>\n<h3 id=\"基础层(第0层)\">基础层(第0层)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6a1ff87567369c3c\" href=\"?note=6a1ff87567369c3c\" title=\"92-df-formal-system\">92-df-formal-system</a> - 形式系统</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" href=\"?note=c56ec2b54fc34fc6\" title=\"92-df-expression\">92-df-expression</a> - 表达式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e0eabee5d77258a7\" href=\"?note=e0eabee5d77258a7\" title=\"92-df-g-system\">92-df-g-system</a> - 系统G</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"第1层\">第1层</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5a1bd470754681a7\" href=\"?note=5a1bd470754681a7\" title=\"92-df-formula\">92-df-formula</a> - 公式</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a> - 句子</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a> - numeral</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a> - Gödel编码</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"第2层\">第2层</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"23b675b1348a813e\" href=\"?note=23b675b1348a813e\" title=\"92-df-proof\">92-df-proof</a> - 证明</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"51c43e0240787ebb\" href=\"?note=51c43e0240787ebb\" title=\"92-df-provable\">92-df-provable</a> - 可证</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a> - 一致</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"6d5d7c9d78e08590\" href=\"?note=6d5d7c9d78e08590\" title=\"92-df-expressible\">92-df-expressible</a> - 可表达</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"d9d845f6cd765d21\" href=\"?note=d9d845f6cd765d21\" title=\"92-df-representable\">92-df-representable</a> - 可表示</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"第3层\">第3层</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"6ad30e82597031a6\" href=\"?note=6ad30e82597031a6\" title=\"92-df-diagonal-function\">92-df-diagonal-function</a> - 对角化函数</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"aed464040ce8d4ec\" href=\"?note=aed464040ce8d4ec\" title=\"92-df-normal-function\">92-df-normal-function</a> - 正规函数</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a> - 可证性谓词</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"b15ebe94f199828c\" href=\"?note=b15ebe94f199828c\" title=\"92-df-omega-consistency\">92-df-omega-consistency</a> - <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"第4层(自引用句子)\">第4层(自引用句子)</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"b823f18a7fc28400\" href=\"?note=b823f18a7fc28400\" title=\"92-df-godel-sentence\">92-df-godel-sentence</a> - Gödel句子</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"71758b63b2ee2736\" href=\"?note=71758b63b2ee2736\" title=\"92-df-lob-sentence\">92-df-lob-sentence</a> - Löb句子</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"67317965f7ebd660\" href=\"?note=67317965f7ebd660\" title=\"92-df-henkin-sentence\">92-df-henkin-sentence</a> - Henkin句子</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"9252d4105cc5f189\" href=\"?note=9252d4105cc5f189\" title=\"92-df-rosser-sentence\">92-df-rosser-sentence</a> - Rosser句子</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a> - 一致性陈述</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"核心定理\">核心定理</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-22\" data-note=\"02b34261c2cb199c\" href=\"?note=02b34261c2cb199c\" title=\"92-thm-first-incompleteness\">92-thm-first-incompleteness</a> - 第一不完备性定理</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-23\" data-note=\"6e56db0129607b23\" href=\"?note=6e56db0129607b23\" title=\"92-thm-rosser-incompleteness\">92-thm-rosser-incompleteness</a> - Rosser定理</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-24\" data-note=\"57ea3ea286817df3\" href=\"?note=57ea3ea286817df3\" title=\"92-thm-second-incompleteness\">92-thm-second-incompleteness</a> - 第二不完备性定理</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-25\" data-note=\"fd30fbde88ab93eb\" href=\"?note=fd30fbde88ab93eb\" title=\"92-thm-lob-theorem\">92-thm-lob-theorem</a> - Löb定理</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-26\" data-note=\"f3fdd55235f4984e\" href=\"?note=f3fdd55235f4984e\" title=\"92-thm-diagonal-lemma\">92-thm-diagonal-lemma</a> - 对角化引理</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-27\" data-note=\"aca515b20bf2fbd3\" href=\"?note=aca515b20bf2fbd3\" title=\"92-thm-tarski-undefinability\">92-thm-tarski-undefinability</a> - Tarski定理</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-28\" data-note=\"0b2170bf5b3075ce\" href=\"?note=0b2170bf5b3075ce\" title=\"92-thm-representability\">92-thm-representability</a> - 可表示性定理</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"与其他书籍的关系\">与其他书籍的关系</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>与<a href=\"?unresolved=88-MOC\" class=\"wiki-link unresolved\" id=\"ref-29\" data-link-target=\"88-MOC\" data-candidates=\"[]\" title=\"此次发布范围内未找到该目标\">88-MOC<span class=\"link-suffix\" aria-label=\"未收录\">↗</span></a>(Computability and Logic)互补：88号书籍从可计算性角度出发</li>\n<li>与<a href=\"?unresolved=89-MOC\" class=\"wiki-link unresolved\" id=\"ref-30\" data-link-target=\"89-MOC\" data-candidates=\"[]\" title=\"此次发布范围内未找到该目标\">89-MOC<span class=\"link-suffix\" aria-label=\"未收录\">↗</span></a>(The Logic of Provability)相关：89号书籍深入可证性逻辑GL</li>\n<li>与<a href=\"?unresolved=90-MOC\" class=\"wiki-link unresolved\" id=\"ref-31\" data-link-target=\"90-MOC\" data-candidates=\"[]\" title=\"此次发布范围内未找到该目标\">90-MOC<span class=\"link-suffix\" aria-label=\"未收录\">↗</span></a>(Diagonalization and Self-Reference)相关：90号书籍专门讨论自引用技术</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"记忆置信度报告\">记忆置信度报告</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>高置信度(≥90%)</strong>: 基础定义、核心定理、系统G结构</li>\n<li><strong>中置信度(50-89%)</strong>: 一些技术细节（如正规函数的具体性质）</li>\n<li><strong>低置信度(&lt;50%)</strong>: 无</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypoth